    Lines:
      Loved:
      - 'Herring! Salt herring and potatoes, my mother''s supper. Out of my own rows, too. Thank you.'
      Liked:
      - 'That''ll feed the four of us. Thank you, truly.'
      Neutral:
      - 'Thank you. It''ll go in the pot with the turnip.'
      Disliked:
      - 'A crab. Sam will want to keep it in a bucket and name it. Thank you, I think.'
